WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.876
Files searches names and paths

00:00:01.876 --> 00:00:09.999
Type part of a filename

00:00:09.999 --> 00:00:16.419
Or narrow by extension: .pdf

00:00:16.419 --> 00:00:22.473
Select once to preview the file

00:00:22.473 --> 00:00:27.991
Filters can restrict the file type

00:00:27.991 --> 00:00:33.145
File > Open Directory limits the search location

00:00:33.145 --> 00:00:38.998
This is a fictional demo folder

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:43.983
Clear restores the broader search scope

00:00:43.983 --> 00:00:50.998
Match Path includes folder names in the search

00:00:50.998 --> 00:00:57.766
Scroll results without opening each file

00:00:57.766 --> 00:01:00.000
Preview first; open only the file you need
